  "cost_formula": "If cacheable input is null: input_tokens * input_price. Otherwise: cacheable_input_tokens * cache_hit_rate * cache_hit_price + (input_tokens - cacheable_input_tokens * cache_hit_rate) * cache_write_price. Missing cache hit or write price uses input price. Add (answer_tokens + reasoning_tokens) * output_price; divide by 1,000,000 and nominal task_count. Missing token components remain missing.",
  "caveats": [
    "Results and prices reflect the source snapshot date.",
    "Blank numeric fields are unknown. Cache price fallback follows the cost formula above.",
    "price_fallback marks entries in the source priceFallbackByModelId map; these are excluded from cost reconstruction.",
    "Analyst Agent pass^5 requires five attempts to be correct; a matching five-attempt cost is unavailable.",
    "HealthBench quality and cost may refer to different versions, so they are excluded from quality/cost analysis.",
    "SciCode counts subproblems nested in problems, rather than independent whole tasks.",
    "CritPt v2 Hard uses critptAgenticHard and 40 tasks; CritPt v2 uses critptAgentic and 70 tasks.",
    "Derived metric views share underlying runs.",
    "Omniscience hallucination denominator is incorrect / (incorrect + partial + not_attempted), not incorrect / attempted.",
    "Fraction and Elo units are labeled; other units are provided where established by the source. Blank units are unknown."
  ],
